comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T08:40:20.975Z",codex-agent,The local capability-refusal regression is green. This item remains blocked until the SDK supplies an authoritative backend-owned conditional mutation service; hosted Postgres/MCP mutation acceptance is deliberately unclaimed. This package does not contact hosted services.
  "2026-10-27T09:14:23.319Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit checked installed SDK 2026.10.26 public declarations: commitItemMutations(options: CommitItemMutationsOptions) requires pmRoot:string and exposes mutations/transactionId/author, with no injected backend client or backend-owned conditional mutation capability. commitWorkspaceTransaction likewise requires pmRoot:string. Local transactions exist and are used; missing remote transport conformance is tracked upstream by open unbraind/pm-cli#1399. No hosted services were accessed."
  "2026-10-27T09:53:39.061Z",codex-agent,PR #1 delivers the local non-git package. Remote mutation enablement still requires host-owned conditional capabilities and real backend conformance; this task stays open. Reviewed merged PR #1 (bdd93506b7dc3f1e4d93ca27af01bc60c375c25e).
